  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-资金、钱包与结算\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"批量查询AD、星图、本地推账户的余额，支持传入多个账户id进行查询，可选择是否拆分赠款类型。\",\"id\":\"account.fund.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/account/fund/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1799006604968971\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"account.get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix_return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"用于查看接口返回码和返回信息的详细说明\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1799006604968971\",\"title\":\"批量查询账户余额\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RfNn8AdN\">批量查询账号余额，支持AD、星图、本地推账户 </p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1796566969214026%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%22dY072%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-KQN6gYIR\" id=\"h346b9f0-KQN6gYIR\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-J9chBSNM\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/account/fund/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/account/fund/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1799006604968971\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-NkJXMZ9Q\" id=\"h346b9f0-NkJXMZ9Q\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-YPE8pi7o\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-kAXXRTEV\" id=\"h346b9f0-kAXXRTEV\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qaSr7DpN\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-LYfR3IDI\" id=\"h346b9f0-LYfR3IDI\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_ids</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Av4g0zph\">需要查询的账户ids，支持<span style=\"color: #333333;\">客户、代理商、星图客户、星图MCN、星图服务商、本地推</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-hZSPWbdP\">注意：</p><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-M8SEURdF\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BCknidPQ\">传入账户id的类型需统一</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-opoA7EVo\">最多支持50个账户</li></ol></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HsP8oEcG\">账户业务类型，可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-OV7812al\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Tg7Z6cTU\"><code>AD</code>AD</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-gYKCCheH\"><code>STAR</code>星图</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-X7T1AIPM\"><code>LOCAL</code>本地推</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">grant_type_split</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VVxbmpBO\"> <span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">是否拆分赠款类型，允许值：</span> </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-SacIQX7M\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ATjlGPfa\"><code>ON</code>开启</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-kJgdq9LI\"><code>OFF</code>关闭（默认）</li></ul></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-oI3NPjG9\" id=\"h346b9f0-oI3NPjG9\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Faccount%2Ffund%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20account_ids_list%20%3D%20ACCOUNT_IDS%5Cn%20%20%20%20account_ids%20%3D%20json.dumps(account_ids_list)%5Cn%20%20%20%20account_type%20%3D%20ACCOUNT_TYPE%5Cn%20%20%20%20grant_type_split%20%3D%20GRANT_TYPE_SPLIT%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20my_args%20%3D%20%5C%22%7B%5C%5C%5C%22account_ids%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%25s%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22account_type%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%22grant_type_split%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%20%5C%5C%5C%22%25s%5C%5C%5C%22%7D%5C%22%20%25%20(account_ids%2C%20account_type%2C%20grant_type_split)%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(get(my_args))%5Cn%20%20%20%20%22%7D%2C%7B%22language%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22import%20com.fasterxml.jackson.core.JsonProcessingException%3B%5Cnimport%20com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ObjectMapper%3B%5Cnimport%20okhttp3.*%3B%5Cnimport%20org.apache.http.client.utils.URIBuilder%3B%5Cn%5Cnimport%20java.io.IOException%3B%5Cnimport%20java.net.URI%3B%5Cnimport%20java.net.URISyntaxException%3B%5Cnimport%20java.net.URL%3B%5Cnimport%20java.util.List%3B%5Cnimport%20java.util.Map%3B%5Cnimport%20java.util.stream.Collectors%3B%5Cn%5Cnpublic%20class%20Demo%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20static%20final%20String%20ACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20static%20final%20String%20PATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Faccount%2Ffund%2Fget%2F%5C%22%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20static%20final%20ObjectMapper%20mapper%20%3D%20new%20ObjectMapper()%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F**%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%40param%20path%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%40return%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20static%20String%20buildUrl(String%20path)%20throws%20URISyntaxException%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20URI%20uri%20%3D%20new%20URI(%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20uri.toString()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F**%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%40param%20jsonStr%3AArgs%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%40return%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20static%20String%20get(String%20jsonStr)%20throws%20IOException%2C%20URISyntaxException%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20OkHttpClient%20client%20%3D%20new%20OkHttpClient().newBuilder().build()%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20URIBuilder%20ub%20%3D%20new%20URIBuilder(buildUrl(PATH))%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Map%3C%20String%2C%20Object%20%3E%20map%20%3D%20mapper.readValue(jsonStr%2C%20Map.class)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20map.forEach((k%2C%20v)%20-%3E%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20try%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20ub.addParameter(k%2C%20v%20instanceof%20String%20%3